From fa49b3fa99f19a7209a757a702e0924f1f8d327a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aegis Development <development@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:32:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(android): revoke Access Options on primary document
 replacement

DevTools Page.setDocumentContent replaces the primary document through
Document::SetContent and the parameterless Document::open(). That path emits
neither DidOpenDocumentInputStream nor DidCommitDocumentReplacement. Notify
the browser from the explicit open so the existing editor is revoked. Ordinary
DOM edits do not reopen the document and stay readable.
